<title>USA: Sel-Leb Marketing 1996 net falls.</title>
<headline>Sel-Leb Marketing 1996 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH BERGEN, N.J. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands except per share amounts)</p>
<p>						  Year Ended December 31,</p>
<p>							 1996	    1995</p>
<p> Revenue					   $13,523	$11,480</p>
<p> Net Income					    158	    339</p>
<p> Earnings Per Common Share			 .02	     --</p>
<p>NOTE: Company previously reported a net income of $0.05 per share for year-end 1995.</p>
<p>Company spokesman said unavailability of 1995 EPS in earnings table will be explained in Form 10K currently filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>The full company name is Sel-Leb Marketing Inc.</p>
</text>
